### 错误标注（序号）
1. HuangShan mountain → Huangshan Mountain（专有名词规范写法，首字母大写）
2. locates → is located（be located in 固定搭配）
3. south side → southern part
4. AnHui province → Anhui Province
5. one of the most famous mountain → one of + 复数 mountains
6. Featuring QiSong, weir stone, cloud sea and fountain：直译中文拼音错误；正确：strange pines, grotesque rocks, sea of clouds, hot springs
7. it is famous for the forth in the world：语义混乱，four wonders 四大奇观
8. attracted → attracts（一般现在时）
9. many both domestic and abroad tourists → numerous domestic and foreign tourists；abroad 是副词，不能修饰名词
10. Huangshan mountain's hill → The peaks of Huangshan；hill 指小山，山峰用 peak
11. dangerous 形容山峰不合适 → steep 险峻
12. cloud frequently around the mountain → clouds often winding around the mountains，缺少谓语结构
13. dreamable：无此单词 → dreamlike
14. was lined at double dead form of global civilization and nature：单词拼写 + 语义完全错误；was inscribed on the World Cultural and Natural Heritage List
15. the Chinese treasures → a treasure of China
16. a related wealth of whole people → the common wealth of all mankind


### 美化原句
Huangshan Mountain is located in the southern part of Anhui Province and is one of the most famous mountains in China. Famous for its four wonders — strange pines, grotesque 
rocks, sea of clouds and hot springs, it attracts numerous domestic and foreign tourists every year. The peaks of Huangshan are tall and steep, with clouds often winding around 
the mountains, creating a dreamlike scenery. In 1990, Huangshan was inscribed on the World Cultural and Natural Heritage List. It is not only a treasure of China but also the 
common wealth of all mankind.


### 标准参考译文
Huangshan Mountain lies in southern Anhui Province and ranks among China’s most famous mountains. Known for its four unique sights: strange pines, fantastic rocks, seas of
clouds and hot springs, it draws plenty of tourists from home and abroad each year. Its towering and steep peaks are often wrapped in clouds, forming fantastic dreamy views. 
In 1990, Huangshan was added to the World Cultural and Natural Heritage List. It is a treasure of China as well as the shared heritage of humanity.
